ity Oversampling Technique), which resulted in the equal distribution of both the classes (0 and 1). Used the following modules in Python-Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-Learn, matplotlib, Imbalanced-learn Logistic Regression gave AUC=0.95, but the precision was very low (0.08). So, I tried Random Forests and it gave AUC=0.94 and precision=0.85 (with 'gini' criterion) and AUC=0.92 & precision=0.83 (with 'entropy' criterion). Measured performance metrics-accuracy, precision, recall, AUC and plotted ROC curve Used the following modules in Python-Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-Learn, matplotlib, Imbalanced-learn","topics":[],"score":235292,"global_rank":93671,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16191},{"name":"HankyuJang/Single-Cell-Classification","owner":"HankyuJang","html_url":"https://github.com/HankyuJang/Single-Cell-Classification","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":235288,"global_rank":93676,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16192},{"name":"J-DUB64/mycode","owner":"J-DUB64","html_url":"https://github.com/J-DUB64/mycode","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"This is your first repo","topics":[],"score":235283,"global_rank":93689,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16193},{"name":"jinyeom/Computational-Intelligence-Research","owner":"jinyeom","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyeom/Computational-Intelligence-Research","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Computational Intelligence Research","topics":[],"score":235280,"global_rank":93691,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16194},{"name":"jayshah19949596/American-Sign-Language-Recognition","owner":"jayshah19949596","html_url":"https://github.com/jayshah19949596/American-Sign-Language-Recognition","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Developed a program that lets users search dictionaries of American 